# Geodashing Global Security Overrides

# 1. Deny access to all sensitive configuration files across the entire application tree natively
<FilesMatch "\.(env|ini|json|lock|md|log)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

# 2. Block direct HTTP web browser execution of backend test suites and vendor frameworks
<DirectoryMatch "^.*/(tests|vendor)/.*$">
    Require all denied
</DirectoryMatch>

# 3. Disable directory browsing globally (preventing users from seeing lists of files)
Options -Indexes
